WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Aloha! Let me answer some frequently asked
questions about AI and your data rights.

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:10.000
How does MedMatch use AI? Our AI analyzes
your resume and preferences to provide matches.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.500
It does not make hiring decisions.
Employers always make the final choice.

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:21.000
What about AI compliance? MedMatch follows
responsible AI principles with fair algorithms.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:27.000
We regularly audit our systems to prevent
discrimination based on protected characteristics.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:32.500
Do you own your data? Absolutely yes.
You retain full ownership of all your information.

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:38.000
Can you delete your data? Yes, at any time.
Visit account settings to download or delete.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:44.000
We comply with GDPR and data protection regulations.
We never sell your personal data to third parties.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Recruiters only see what you choose to make visible.
Our AI suggests jobs based on your preferences.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:56.000
You control the matching by setting
your own filters and criteria.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:02.000
Thank you for trusting MedMatch with your
career journey. Your rights are our priority.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:07.000
Mahalo!
